}=\\frac{1}{u}.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$  In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 5**: Compute the required area.\n\nWe calculate the required area by performing the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\text{d}x\\text{d}y & ={∬}_{Δ}|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}|\\frac{1}{u}|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{4}^{7}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u{\\int }_{4}^{8}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)\\cdot (8-4) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\frac{7}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1075 #edb/ref 17592186557463 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1075 #edb/ref 17592186557474 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1075 #edb/ref 17592186557476 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1075 #edb/ref 17592186557487 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1075 #edb/ref 17592186557493 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1077 "selection" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1078 #edb/ref 17592186557474 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557461 1079 #uuid "5a1ce500-1558-50c5-bb88-90956f218df6" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557462 1080 "\\frac{3}{8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557462 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557462 1083 #uuid "603d58c2-77dc-53d3-835f-ca352ce1e392" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557463 1080 "12" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557463 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557463 1083 #uuid "615769bf-cd9e-5b6c-bdf0-52ec2d404c73" 13194139536013 17592186045443 true] [17592186557464 